  "description": "Beta cohort day-trial monitoring (§4.4 / CAL-4 / path-to-4.0 gate). 6 panels covering the metrics enumerated in concepts/operations/beta-cohort-onboarding-runbook.md Phase 4. Filter by `beta_tenant` variable to scope to the customer's tenant slug. Refresh defaults to 30s during the active 24h window.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "iteration": 1715515200000,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Day-trial budget remaining",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(86400 - (time() - on() (max(loop_runtime_beta_trial_started_at_seconds{tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}) or vector(time())))) / 3600",
          "legendFormat": "hours remaining",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 6 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 12 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "h"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Hours left in the 24h day-trial window. Requires recording rule `loop_runtime_beta_trial_started_at_seconds{tenant=X}` set when the customer's first service goes Healthy (operator emits via curl to the API's /internal/recording endpoint — falls back to `vector(time())` if not set, which shows the trial as expired-by-default to force operator to wire the rule)."
    },
    {
      "title": "Incidents in last 24h (SEV-1 + SEV-2)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(loop_runtime_sev_1_total{tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}[24h])) + sum(increase(loop_runtime_sev_2_total{tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "incidents",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Any non-zero value invalidates the §4.4 day-trial gate per the runbook. Stat goes red on the first incident."
    },
    {
      "title": "API request p95 latency (target < 500ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(loop_runtime_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(loop_runtime_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "ms",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 300 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 500 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Tenant-scoped p95 must stay under 500ms per the Phase 4 dashboard criteria. Yellow at 300ms (warning), red at 500ms (breach)."
    },
    {
      "title": "Builds succeeded vs failed (24h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 4,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (increase(loop_runtime_builds_total{tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "FAILED" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": 0 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "SUCCEEDED" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Stat per build status. FAILED count > 0 turns red and is a customer-bug signal (NOT a platform-fault signal unless the rate is anomalously high). Operator cross-references with audit_log to classify."
    },
    {
      "title": "Auth failures (target < 5 over 24h)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(loop_runtime_audit_log_total{action=~\"auth\\\\..*\",tenant=\"$beta_tenant\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "auth failures/hour",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "count/h",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 50,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Bar chart of hourly auth-failure rows in audit_log scoped to the Beta tenant. A spike with no preceding deploy or rotation event is investigated. Phase A.4 of Wave 1 wired the 9 failure paths that emit these rows."
    },
    {
      "title": "Custom-domain TLS days-to-expiry (target > 7)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "id": 6,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loop_runtime_domain_tls_expiry_days",
          "legendFormat": "{{domain}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "days",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "always"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 7 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 14 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "d"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Audit §6.C.8 dropped the `tenant` label from this gauge (cardinality cap), so this panel intentionally shows ALL domains and the operator filters by domain name in the legend. For per-tenant attribution see the `loop_runtime_custom_domains_total{tenant}` join described in beta-weekly-status-template.md."
    }
  ],
